{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2021-12-14 10:30:00', 'title': 'THE LUXURY COLLECTION ANNOUNCES NEW GLOBAL EXPLORER CAROLINE DE MAIGRET', 'text': "NEW YORK, DEC. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE LUXURY COLLECTION, PART OF MARRIOTT BONVOY'S PORTFOLIO OF 30 EXTRAORDINARY HOTEL BRANDS,\xa0ANNOUNCES CAROLINE DE MAIGRET AS THE BRAND'S NEWEST GLOBAL EXPLORER. IN HER ROLE AS A BRAND AMBASSADOR, DE MAIGRET HAS COLLABORATED WITH THE LUXURY COLLECTION TO PRODUCE A NIGHT IN SEVILLE AND THE MORNING AFTER \xa0-- A GUIDE TO HER FAVORITE PLACES TO STAY, DINE AND DISCOVER PUBLISHED BY ASSOULINE."}